## Interface: 16001
## Title: Loot Tracker
## Notes: Tracks what you loot and from what: creatures, skinning, pickpocketing, chests, lockboxes, resource nodes and fishing, with gold and item values (vendor or auction). Standalone: needs no other addon; uses SharedMedia fonts and textures when other addons add them.
## Author: cloudfan
## Version: 1.0.0
## OptionalDeps: LibSharedMedia-3.0, SharedMedia
## SavedVariables: LootTrackerSettings, LootTrackerPrices, LootTrackerNames
